EXL3 decode/verify linear: up to 4 passes of 16 rows share one weight decode (stock re-read and re-decoded the
weights every 16 rows); at 49-64 and 97-128 rows a 128-column block's tiles split over 2 blocks, which meet in Z.
Every row bit-identical to stock (same K slices, k order, fragments and warp-order sums); TENSORFOLD_EXL3_MP=1 is stock.

